title: Jesus saves
pid: c7af87a9-b530-4561-9f68-020f60e877cb
body: |2-
  Yours is the system that
  writes to disk and the session-lifetime stores.

  Maybe this system can be perfect,
  and you can rest at peace for eternity thereafter.
  Or maybe we'll think that happened,
  only to later have to resurrect you.
